# Direct-download shortcuts for Nekomo APKs.
# These point at the fixed filenames in the Nekomo-App/Neko-Source "apks" folder,
# which are overwritten in place on every build (apks/latest.json lists version, build time and SHA-256), so these URLs never go stale.
# 302 (not 301) on purpose: the file at each URL changes over time, only the path is permanent.
#
# IMPORTANT: if the apks folder filenames are ever renamed, update the targets below to match.
/Nekomo-phone-release.apk  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Nekomo-App/Neko-Source/main/apks/Nekomo-phone-release.apk  302
/Nekomo-phone-beta.apk     https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Nekomo-App/Neko-Source/main/apks/Nekomo-phone-beta.apk     302
/Nekomo-phone-debug.apk    https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Nekomo-App/Neko-Source/main/apks/Nekomo-phone-debug.apk    302
/Nekomo-tv-release.apk     https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Nekomo-App/Neko-Source/main/apks/Nekomo-tv-release.apk     302
/Nekomo-tv-beta.apk        https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Nekomo-App/Neko-Source/main/apks/Nekomo-tv-beta.apk        302
/Nekomo-tv-debug.apk       https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Nekomo-App/Neko-Source/main/apks/Nekomo-tv-debug.apk       302
